      "text": "Eth1/1–6 → ctrl1–6     Eth1/7 → bastion\nEth1/8–9 → flashblade-1     Eth1/10–11 → flashblade-2\nEth1/12 (proposed) → flashblade-1 mgmt on leaf1, -2 on leaf2; 1G via QSA",
