      "text": "Frontend uplinks require FOUR ports per leaf; exact ports unresolved.\nFrontend/OOB IPs, VLANs, VNIs and ASNs to finalize.\nSettled 24 Sep: backend uplinks BGP unnumbered; FlashBlade bond\nas drawn; FlashBlade mgmt 1G via QSA + 1000BASE-T; backend\nPFC + ECN as in the production switch configuration.",
